1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,097
Writing, task two. E-mail number 18: I'm sorry.

2
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:17,837
You want to apologise to a friend for not coming to a meeting. Write her an e-mail of at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:26,533 --> 00:00:27,537
Hi Hana,

4
00:00:27,833 --> 00:00:30,280
I'm very sorry I didn't come yesterday.

5
00:00:30,567 --> 00:00:33,823
I had to stay at work because a colleague was ill.

6
00:00:34,133 --> 00:00:37,081
I didn't call you because my phone battery died.

7
00:00:37,367 --> 00:00:39,212
Can we meet on Saturday afternoon?

8
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,801
We'll go to the café on the square, I'll treat you to coffee and cake.

9
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:50,320
This e-mail has 48 words. One sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

10
00:00:51,033 --> 00:01:00,044
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
